Subject: [PATCH] Default the installed Asio selector to system dependencies

The installed CMake module can otherwise download source when a networking
consumer calls glaze_setup_asio(). Distro consumers should use system Asio
or Boost, and opt in explicitly if they want upstream's download behavior.

--- a/cmake/glaze-asio.cmake
+++ b/cmake/glaze-asio.cmake
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@
 
 option(glaze_USE_BUNDLED_ASIO
     "Download Asio via FetchContent if no system Asio/Boost is found (disable for distro builds)"
-    ON
+    OFF
 )
 
 function(glaze_setup_asio)
